l_class=&#8221;col-sc_service_box&#8221; width=&#8221;1\/2&#8243;]\t<div class=\"image_featured_text paragraph slide_img\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" src=\"https:\/\/www.dhinimex.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/quality-3.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"text\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Construction and Installation<\/h3>We deliver end-to-end\u00a0<strong>power infrastructure solutions<\/strong>\u2014from poles and transformers to fully equipped substations.<\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div><a\thref=\"\/dhinimex\/services\/construction-and-installation\"  \n\t\t\t\tclass=\"button btn_medium btn_blue btn_rounded btn_outline icon_pos_after  boc_animate_when_almost_visible boc_top-to-bottom btn-our_service_box\"  target='_blank'><span>Read More<\/span> <i class='icon fa fa-long-arrow-right'><\/i> <\/a>[\/vc_column_inner][\/vc_row_inner][vc_row_inner][vc_column_inner el_class=&#8221;col-sc_service_box&#8221; width=&#8221;1\/2&#8243;]\t<div class=\"image_featured_text paragraph slide_img\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" src=\"https:\/\/www.dhinimex.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/quality-2.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"text\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Testing and Engineering Consultation<\/h3>From relay setting and transformer oil purification to system diagnostics, our testing services are designed to maximize performance and extend equipment lifespan. We deliver precise, trusted results to support smooth operations.<\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div><a\thref=\"\/dhinimex\/services\/testing-and-engineering-consultation\"  \n\t\t\t\tclass=\"button btn_medium btn_blue btn_rounded btn_outline icon_pos_after  boc_animate_when_almost_visible boc_top-to-bottom btn-our_service_box\"  target='_blank'><span>Read More<\/span> <i class='icon fa fa-long-a